  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "結婚講好話（五）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>楊忠憲</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">新娘生suí面肉白，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目睭圓圓親像月，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">西施比你khah輸勢，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">貂蟬是beh算啥貨。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">貴妃侍候你泡茶，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">昭君為你來穿鞋，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">穿插端莊徛好勢，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">招待人客真好禮。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有手腕又ē交際，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">貴賓光臨講好話，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">喙笑目笑知進退，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">厝內穡頭真gâu做。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">入灶跤ē做發粿，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">發leh規家伙，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">透早透暗ē掃地，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">奉待ke-kuann真得體。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">每日無閒到半暝，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">好新婦m̄驚khang-khuè濟，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">讀冊人厝in外家，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">ooh～莫怪新娘真有底。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">新娘入門ē興家，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">新郎福氣娶好妻，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">各位來賓，khiàng跤新婦，用手電仔tshiō mā無tè揣，tio̍h m̄-tio̍h？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">名聲khah芳玉蘭花，祝福tsit對新人，長壽食百歲。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCZehMdzz4nsbAusailHy7eP3X3qARi5Kv9_b_YXvOT0sTKblrRUBtdSiuMgJ_tW5DjNLFDoLpB7LMpKaEKLTeH09CnU_ll0s0O0l3Up32MxWlpTxHciTVt-ZkxOmSj7wEqXPnA6c0ehPDPB87fpO8tJS-IraVunx_xKeFLuEOm6cEAzpvcGQhaaQez5V9/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_05_A.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCZehMdzz4nsbAusailHy7eP3X3qARi5Kv9_b_YXvOT0sTKblrRUBtdSiuMgJ_tW5DjNLFDoLpB7LMpKaEKLTeH09CnU_ll0s0O0l3Up32MxWlpTxHciTVt-ZkxOmSj7wEqXPnA6c0ehPDPB87fpO8tJS-IraVunx_xKeFLuEOm6cEAzpvcGQhaaQez5V9/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_05_A.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p><span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://